  ('df95fec8-4134-5455-9b76-4627d8637d31', 100001, '4010589e-92cd-50fa-9360-5709757a0fa8', 'searchWeb', 'POST', '/v1/tools/search', 'Search the web', 'Searches the live web for a query and returns structured results. Query operators (site:, -site:, -term, -"exact phrase", "exact phrase", lang:, after:, before:) are forwarded unchanged to the DeepSeek search engine. Billing is per successful request and independent of count: a request that returns an empty `results` array is not billed, and raising `count` never changes the price. DeepSeek limits Search to 5 requests per second per account, counted independently of Fetch.', $sdkwork_catalog$["Tools"]$sdkwork_catalog$::jsonb, FALSE, 1320),
